@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber
actor Shawn
participant "WorkoutScreen" as UI
participant "WorkoutSessionController" as Session
participant "CameraX" as Camera
participant "LatestFrameScheduler" as Scheduler
participant "MediaPipe Pose" as Pose
participant "TelemetrySamplerChunker" as TelemetryStage
participant "CoordinateNormalizer" as Normalize
participant "SignalProcessor" as Signal
participant "TrackingQualityGate" as Gate
participant "InclineDbPressAnalyzer" as Analyzer
participant "BiomechanicsMetrics" as Metrics
participant "RuleEngine + EpisodeTracker" as Rules
participant "CueArbitrator" as Cue
queue "ShortLivedTelemetryBuffer" as TelemetryQ
queue "PriorityPersistenceQueue" as PriorityQ
participant "BatchWriter" as Writer
participant "WorkoutRepository" as Repo
database "Room / SQLite" as DB

Shawn -> UI : select Incline Dumbbell Press
Shawn -> UI : Start Set
UI -> Session : startSet()
Session -> Repo : create ACTIVE ExerciseSet\ntelemetryExpiresAt = startedAt + 7 days
Repo -> DB : persist set state
Session -> Camera : start accepting frames

loop each camera frame
  Camera -> Scheduler : frame + monotonic timestamp
  Scheduler -> Pose : newest eligible frame
  Pose -> TelemetryStage : PoseObservation\nlandmarks + transform metadata only
  TelemetryStage -> TelemetryStage : bounded-rate sample + chunk
  opt chunk ready
    TelemetryStage -> TelemetryQ : PoseObservationChunk
  end
  Pose --> Normalize : same pose output
  Normalize --> Signal : canonical coordinates
  Signal --> Gate : MovementFrame
  alt tracking invalid
    Gate --> UI : setup / visibility guidance
    Gate -> TelemetryQ : TrackingEvent on meaningful state change
    alt invalid gap exceeds tolerated duration
      Gate -> Analyzer : resetTemporalState(TRACKING_GAP)
      Gate -> Rules : interruptActiveEpisodes(TRACKING_GAP)
      Rules -> PriorityQ : FormEvent upserts with status=INTERRUPTED
    end
  else valid
    Gate --> Analyzer : valid frame
    Analyzer -> Analyzer : update rep state
    Analyzer -> Metrics : calculate metrics
    Metrics -> Rules : metrics + phase + recent history
    Rules -> Rules : update rule episode states\nPENDING / ACTIVE / FINALIZED

    alt issue crosses persistence threshold
      Rules -> PriorityQ : activate FormEvent + initial FormEvidence
    end
    alt active issue updates materially or finalizes
      Rules -> PriorityQ : upsert same FormEvent id + final evidence/end
    end

    Rules --> Cue : active actionable issue state
    alt CueArbitrator selects feedback
      Cue --> UI : one prioritized visual cue
      opt offline TTS voice available
        Cue --> UI : speak same short cue via local TTS
      end
      Cue -> PriorityQ : CueDelivery
    else issue suppressed by priority/cooldown
      Cue --> Cue : no delivery record
    end

    alt rep completed
      Analyzer --> UI : increment rep count
      Analyzer -> PriorityQ : rep summary + CompactRepTrace
      Metrics -> PriorityQ : final rep metrics
      Rules -> PriorityQ : finalize any rep-scoped active episodes
    end
  end
end

loop async priority persistence
  PriorityQ -> Writer : next priority batch
  Writer -> Repo : persist / upsert
  Repo -> DB : transaction
end
loop async short-lived telemetry persistence
  TelemetryQ -> Writer : next best-effort batch
  Writer -> Repo : persist PoseObservationChunk / TrackingEvent
  Repo -> DB : transaction
end

Shawn -> UI : Stop Set
UI -> Session : stopSet()
Session -> Camera : stop accepting new frames
Session -> Scheduler : await in-flight analysis quiescence
Scheduler --> Session : pipeline idle
Session -> TelemetryStage : flush partial short-lived chunk best-effort
TelemetryStage -> TelemetryQ : optional final PoseObservationChunk
Session -> Analyzer : finalizeSet()\nclose partial/in-progress rep state
Analyzer -> PriorityQ : partial/aborted rep summary if applicable
Session -> Rules : finalizeSet()\nclose all active FormEvent episodes
Rules -> PriorityQ : final FormEvent upserts
Session -> PriorityQ : enqueue SetCloseBarrier\nendedAt + status=COMPLETED\ntelemetryExpiresAt = endedAt + 7 days
PriorityQ -> Writer : drain earlier priority records, then barrier
Writer -> Repo : commit pending priority data + close set
Repo -> DB : durable transaction(s)
Writer --> Session : SetCloseBarrier committed
Session --> UI : set saved / closed
UI --> Shawn : saved

note over Pose,TelemetryStage
Realtime inference rate and persistence sampling rate are independent.
Pose data is sampled/chunked before Room so storage does not scale as
one database row per analyzed frame.
end note

note over Gate,Rules
A significant tracking gap is a temporal discontinuity.
The interrupted rep is not resumed after recovery; analyzer/rule state
restarts from a fresh stable movement state.
end note

note over Rules,PriorityQ
A continuous form problem is one FormEvent episode, not one event/frame.
The same FormEvent id is activated then finalized/upserted.
This prevents frame-rate-dependent long-term data growth.
end note

note over Session,Scheduler
SetCloseBarrier is enqueued only after the analysis pipeline is idle
and analyzer/rule in-memory state has been finalized.
No late high-value record may appear behind the close barrier.
Short-lived telemetry remains best-effort and does not gate set close.
end note

note over TelemetryQ,PriorityQ
Storage is outside the coaching critical path.
Short-lived telemetry may be dropped under pressure.
PriorityPersistenceQueue is in-memory scheduling, not durable storage;
records become durable after Room commit.
end note

note over Writer,Session
Normal Stop Set has an explicit durability barrier for higher-value data.
A process crash may still lose uncommitted current data; on next startup,
stale ACTIVE workout/execution/set/form-event records are recovered
as INTERRUPTED.
end note

@enduml
